  "summary": "GREENVILLE, S.C., June 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- United Community Banks, Inc. (NYSE: UCB) announces it will release its second quarter 2026 financial results on Tuesday, July 21, 2026, before the stock market opens. The company also will hold a conference call at 9:00 a.m.",
